      "key": "TUTORIAL_0",
      "text": "连续点击三个一模一样的瓷砖去除它们。清理整个场地！"
    },
    {
      "bundle": "localization-string-tables-chinese(simplified)(zh)_assets_all.bundle",
      "object_id": 2055990762816530872,
      "table": "CoreTutorial_zh",
      "id": 783721422848,
      "key": "TUTORIAL_1",
      "text": "连续点击三个一模一样的瓷砖去除它们。清理整个场地！"
    },
    {
      "bundle": "localization-string-tables-chinese(simplified)(zh)_assets_all.bundle",
      "object_id": 2055990762816530872,
      "table": "CoreTutorial_zh",
      "id": 899828146176,
      "key": "TUTORIAL_2",
      "text": "不要把架子完全填满——你会输掉这一关！"
    },
    {
      "bundle": "localization-string-tables-chinese(simplified)(zh)_assets_all.bundle",
      "object_id": 2055990762816530872,
      "table": "CoreTutorial_zh",
      "id": 987455545344,
      "key": "TUTORIAL_3",
      "text": "试试“撤销”——它可以帮你收回上一步操作！"
    },
    {
      "bundle": "localization-string-tables-chinese(simplified)(zh)_assets_all.bundle",
      "object_id": 2055990762816530872,
      "table": "CoreTutorial_zh",
      "id": 1070578262016,
      "key": "TUTORIAL_4",
      "text": "试试「Dice」——它会打乱所有方块！"
    },
    {
      "bundle": "localization-string-tables-chinese(simplified)(zh)_assets_all.bundle",
      "object_id": 2055990762816530872,
      "table": "CoreTutorial_zh",
      "id": 1138479849472,
      "key": "TUTORIAL_5",
      "text": "试试「魔法棒」——它会帮你走一步！"
    },
    {
      "bundle": "localization-string-tables-chinese(simplified)(zh)_assets_all.bundle",
      "object_id": 2055990762816530872,
      "table": "CoreTutorial_zh",
      "id": 1220923088896,
      "key": "TUTORIAL_6",
      "text": "试试「退牌」——它会把收集的3块牌放回场上！"
    },
    {
      "bundle": "localization-string-tables-chinese(simplified)(zh)_assets_all.bundle",
      "object_id": 2055990762816530872,
      "table": "CoreTutorial_zh",
      "id": 1285611839488,
      "key": "TUTORIAL_7",
      "text": "黄色瓷砖是奖励——点击一次即可使用！"
    },
    {
      "bundle": "localization-string-tables-chinese(simplified)(zh)_assets_all.bundle",
      "object_id": 2055990762816530872,
      "table": "CoreTutorial_zh",
      "id": 1398426034176,
      "key": "TUTORIAL_9",
      "text": "你可以把架子上的任意方块移回到场上。"
    },
    {
      "bundle": "localization-string-tables-chinese(simplified)(zh)_assets_all.bundle",
      "object_id": 2055990762816530872,
      "table": "CoreTutorial_zh",
      "id": 86844040908103680,
      "key": "TUTORIAL_11",
      "text": "点击这里前往商店！"
